{"questions":[{"question":"Kva er volumet av ein boks som er $2 \\text{ m} \\times 3 \\text{ m} \\times 1{,}5 \\text{ m}$?","options":["$9 \\text{ m}^3$","$6{,}5 \\text{ m}^3$","$6 \\text{ m}^3$","$11 \\text{ m}^3$"],"explanation":"Volum $= \\text{lengd} \\cdot \\text{breidd} \\cdot \\text{høgd} = 2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 1{,}5 = 9 \\text{ m}^3$."},{"question":"Kor mange liter er 1 m$^3$?","options":["1 000 liter","100 liter","10 liter","10 000 liter"],"explanation":"$1 \\text{ m}^3 = 1\\,000$ liter. Dette er ei viktig omrekning å hugse."},{"question":"Ein sylinder har radius 2 m og høgd 3 m. Kva er volumet?","options":["$12\\pi \\text{ m}^3$ (ca. 37,7 m$^3$)","$6\\pi \\text{ m}^3$","$18\\pi \\text{ m}^3$","$4\\pi \\text{ m}^3$"],"explanation":"Volum sylinder $= \\pi \\cdot r^2 \\cdot h = \\pi \\cdot 4 \\cdot 3 = 12\\pi \\text{ m}^3$."},{"question":"Kva er overflatearealet av ein kube med side 3 m?","options":["$54 \\text{ m}^2$","$27 \\text{ m}^2$","$9 \\text{ m}^2$","$81 \\text{ m}^2$"],"explanation":"Overflate kube $= 6 \\cdot s^2 = 6 \\cdot 9 = 54 \\text{ m}^2$."},{"question":"Betong kostar 1 800 kr/m$^3$. Kva kostar 2,5 m$^3$ betong?","options":["4 500 kr","720 kr","7 200 kr","4 050 kr"],"explanation":"Kostnad $= 2{,}5 \\cdot 1\\,800 = 4\\,500$ kr."}],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"6b7be70ed9150adb","translatedAt":"2026-06-21T22:11:39.408Z","model":"claude-code-agent","strings":30,"tm":{"3f74174361e03074":"Kva er volumet av ein boks som er $2 \\text{ m} \\times 3 \\text{ m} \\times 1{,}5 \\text{ m}$?","7b53a61d8c78da5b":"$9 \\text{ m}^3$","8fe1533efdbf0df9":"$6{,}5 \\text{ m}^3$","43ace5a649515311":"$6 \\text{ m}^3$","32b63bb33f04e19f":"$11 \\text{ m}^3$","b035333f1bc164b2":"Volum $= \\text{lengd} \\cdot \\text{breidd} \\cdot \\text{høgd} = 2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 1{,}5 = 9 \\text{ m}^3$.","5b4e1b8f971ba244":"Kor mange liter er 1 m$^3$?","fa7929965acaf144":"1 000 liter","f5ac9cc31544ba10":"100 liter","77d3cbe0e6848ad9":"10 liter","3307c64df5207419":"10 000 liter","13065b6772b6afa0"